    "The service returned HTTP {status}.": "Layanan mengembalikan HTTP {status}.",
    "The service did not return a Payload Manager version.": "Layanan tidak mengembalikan versi Payload Manager.",
    "Select an installed ELF inside the Payload Manager repository, local, or USB payload directory.": "Pilih ELF terpasang di direktori payload repositori Payload Manager, lokal, atau USB.",
    "Payload Manager cannot launch itself through its payload API.": "Payload Manager tidak dapat menjalankan dirinya sendiri melalui API payload-nya.",
