    "PS5 Payload Manager requires a PS5.": "PS5 Payload Manager memerlukan PS5.",
    "Console browser": "Peramban konsol",
    "No console browser detected": "Peramban konsol tidak terdeteksi",
    "Enter the {platform} LAN address when using a PC, phone or another console.": "Masukkan alamat LAN {platform} saat memakai PC, ponsel, atau konsol lain.",
    "Enter the console LAN IPv4 address. Loopback points to this computer.": "Masukkan alamat IPv4 LAN konsol. Alamat loopback mengarah ke komputer ini.",
    "The console hostname must resolve only to private LAN IPv4 addresses.": "Nama host konsol harus hanya mengarah ke alamat IPv4 LAN privat.",
    "A locally hosted ready-to-use file is required for the sender.": "Pengirim memerlukan berkas siap pakai yang dihosting secara lokal.",
