    "Find the console LAN address in Settings → Network → View Connection Status. When using a PC or phone, enter the {platform} address here. Browser detection does not discover another device on your network.": "Temukan alamat LAN konsol di Pengaturan → Jaringan → Lihat Status Koneksi. Saat memakai PC atau ponsel, masukkan alamat {platform} di sini. Deteksi peramban tidak menemukan perangkat lain di jaringan.",
