    "Web Serial requires a compatible desktop browser on HTTPS or localhost. PS4/PS5 browsers cannot flash an ESP device with this tool.": "Web Serial memerlukan browser desktop kompatibel di HTTPS atau localhost. Browser PS4/PS5 tidak dapat menulis ESP dengan alat ini.",
    "Program your own compatible ESP host hardware from a desktop browser. The library and device stubs are hosted on this site. This is a hardware setup tool; it does not jailbreak a console.": "Tulis perangkat ESP kompatibel milik Anda lewat browser desktop. Pustaka dan stub dihosting di situs ini. Alat ini mengatur perangkat keras, bukan menjailbreak konsol.",
    "Connect uploads the library's temporary device stub to RAM. It does not erase or program flash. Choose files built for your exact ESP board and follow their published flash offsets.": "Koneksi memuat stub sementara ke RAM tanpa menghapus atau menulis flash. Gunakan file untuk papan ESP yang tepat dan offset terbitannya.",
    ". Local firmware files stay in this browser and are sent only to the selected serial device. No firmware is selected, erased or flashed automatically.": ". File firmware lokal tetap di browser ini dan hanya dikirim ke perangkat serial pilihan. Tidak ada pemilihan, penghapusan, atau penulisan firmware otomatis.",
